5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we must ensure the operational side is sustainable. I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't keep repeating the same mistakes. I'm going to look at the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme and those two pilots from eight years ago.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know what the ground actually hides. I'll check the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells and the joint operators' committee minutes.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm worried about the long-term costs. I think I'll look at the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see where the time actually goes! I'll check the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city and the journey audits on where minutes go.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
